ck\"><div class=\"button-text-item\">Get in touch</div></a></div></div></nav><div class=\"navbar-menu-button w-nav-button\"><div class=\"menu-icon\"><div class=\"menu-icon-line-top\"></div><div class=\"menu-icon-line-middle\"><div class=\"menu-icon-line-middle-inner\"></div></div><div class=\"menu-icon-line-bottom\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"main-wrapper\"><header class=\"section-case-study-header\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"section-padding-large\"><div class=\"case-study-header-component\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-large\"><div id=\"w-node-_180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ea3-bf4e6f9b\" class=\"w-layout-grid case-study-header-content-wrapper\"><div id=\"w-node-_180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ea4-bf4e6f9b\" class=\"case-study-content-left\"><div data-w-id=\"180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416eaa\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"case-study-tags-list\"><div class=\"project-tag\"><div>PPC</div></div><div class=\"project-tag\"><div>SEO</div></div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><h1 data-w-id=\"180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ea6\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-style-h1 weight-medium\">BurgerHaven Restaurant</h1></div><div data-w-id=\"180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ea8\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"text-size-medium\">Sizzling Digital Transformation for BurgerHaven Restaurant</div></div><div id=\"w-node-_180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416eb4-bf4e6f9b\" data-w-id=\"180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416eb4\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"w-layout-grid case-study-information-wrapper\"><div id=\"w-node-_180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ec1-bf4e6f9b\" class=\"case-study-information-item\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><div class=\"heading-style-h6\">Objective</div></div><div class=\"text-size-regular\">Boost foot traffic and expand customer base.</div></div><div id=\"w-node-_180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ec7-bf4e6f9b\" class=\"case-study-information-item\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-xsmall\"><div class=\"heading-style-h6\">Strategy</div></div><div class=\"text-size-regular\">Launched engaging social media campaigns on Facebook and Instagram featuring &quot;Burger of the Week&quot; and a user-generated content contest.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"case-study-header-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66386a9c5a29d081bf4e6f63/663a47dee92fa62a03e898be_Untitled%20design%20(28).webp\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"opacity:0\" data-w-id=\"180cb7ff-022e-fea6-841c-023229416ece\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"90vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66386a9c5a29d081bf4e6f63/663a47dee92fa62a03e898be_Untitled%20design%20(28)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66386a9c5a29d081bf4e6f63/663a47dee92fa62a03e898be_Untitled%20design%20(28)-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66386a9c5a29d081bf4e6f63/663a47dee92fa62a03e898be_Untitled%20design%20(28).webp 1080w\" class=\"case-study-header-image\"/></div></div></div></div></div></header><div class=\"section-case-study-details\"><div class=\"case-study-details-wrapper\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-small\"><div class=\"section-padding-large\"><div data-w-id=\"9dd69dc3-d5e6-8c7c-b346-fa03313cb138\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"w-richtext\"><h2>About the Project</h2><p>‍</p><p>Our initial strategy involved a complete revamp of BurgerHaven’s website to ensure a user-friendly experience that also integrated seamlessly with their new online ordering system. The goal was to make it as easy as possible for customers to browse the menu, place orders, and find information about the restaurant.</p><p>‍</p><p>Simultaneously, we launched a dynamic social media campaign across Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter. This campaign centered around showcasing BurgerHaven’s mouth-watering burger creations, highlighting their commitment to quality ingredients, and fostering community through user-generated content. Weekly features like &quot;Fan Photo Friday&quot; and &quot;Burger of the Month&quot; encouraged customers to engage directly with the brand, sharing their experiences and favorite meals.</p><p>‍</p><p>To support direct communication with their customer base, we implemented an email marketing strategy that included monthly newsletters, promotions, and exclusive offers for subscribers. This not only kept BurgerHaven top-of-mind among its patrons but also drove repeat business and loyalty.</p><p>‍</p><p>Analytics and monitoring were integral throughout the project, allowing us to refine our strategies based on real-time feedback and engagement metrics, ensuring continuous improvement and effectiveness of the marketing efforts.</p><figure style=\"max-width:1920px\" class=\"w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image\"><div><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/66386a9c5a29d081bf4e6f63/663b80fa8e8e2e1d9c57da05_Image%20(17).webp\"/></div></figure><h2>Client Testimonial</h2><p>‍</p><blockquote><em>&quot;The transformation was nothing short of amazing. Our new website beautifully reflects our brand and has significantly streamlined the ordering process, leading to an increase in online sales by 65%. Our social media platforms have become buzzing communities of burger lovers, sharing stories and photos that truly capture the joy of dining with us.&quot;</em></blockquote><p>‍</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section-projects\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"section-padding-large\"><div class=\"project-section-header\"><div class=\"max-width-large\"><div data-w-id=\"dd584e17-c935-3297-54f4-1712a243a12d\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"tagline-pill\"><div>Other projects</div></div><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><h2 data-w-id=\"dd584e17-c935-3297-54f4-1712a243a131\" style=\"opacity:0\" class=\"heading-style-h2 weight-medium\">See our work</h2></div><p data-w-id=\"dd584e17-c935-329